<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lĕo</span></b> , ōnis,
			m.
		Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέων, λίς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a lion</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">validus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 985</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulvus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					10, 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					7, 373</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magnanimus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 3, 5, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leoni praecipua generositas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 16, 17, § 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gaetulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 351</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Poenus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. E.
					5, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phrygius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					A. 10, 157</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulvus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 159</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leonum animi index cauda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 16, 17, § 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leo alumnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					14, 247</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pardus, tigris, leo— si quid adhuc
					est quod fremat in terris violentius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8,
					36</span></i>
			: leo femina, <i>a she-lion, lioness</i> (for
			leaena), Plaut. Fragm. ap. Philarg. <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 2,
				63</span></i>.—Without femina: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">orbati leones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 2, 1, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Fl. 6, 317</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A lion's skin</i>, <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 8,
				126</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The constellation</i> Leo: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">momenta Leonis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 10, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum sol in Leone est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 17, 102, § 162</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in pectore Leonis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					18, 26, 64, § 235</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A kind of crab</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 31,
				51, § 97</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, perhaps <i>lion's-foot</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 10, 260</span></i>; <i><span class="en">98</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>E.</b>
			To denote a courageous person: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in pace leones, in proelio cervi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Coron. Mil. 1 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in praetoriis leones, in castris lepores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 5, 7 <i>med.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">domi leones, foris vulpes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 44, 4</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
